<title>USA: North Side Savings holders okay merger.</title>
<headline>North Side Savings holders okay merger.</headline>
<dateline>FLORAL PARK, N.Y. 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>North Side Savings Bank said on Tuesday that its stockholders approved the previously announced merger of the company with North Fork Bank, the wholly-owned subsidiary of North Fork Bancorp Inc.</p>
<p>North Side said that shareholders of North Fork Bancorp also approved the transaction.</p>
<p>The company said it expects the transaction to close by the end of the year, following receipt of regulatory approval.</p>
</text>
